    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Quickdraw Protocol</h2><p><em>The first second decides who gets a second.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You may draw or stow a weapon as part of rolling Initiative (Intrigue).</p><p>Additionally, during the first round of combat, you reroll the lowest die on your first attack roll made with a weapon you drew this way.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ First round: your attack rolls reroll the lowest die; the drawn-weapon gate is read by the GM.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
